 tuplet-portion type provides optional full control over tuplet specifications. It allows the number and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"note type (including dots) to be set for the actual and normal portions of a single tuplet. If any of these"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements are absent, their values are based on the time-modification element."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Portion"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Portion"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet\/portion"}}}